          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the east side, which is to be four thousand five hundred cubits, three gates, the gate of Joseph, the gate of Benjamin, and the gate of Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
